  "headline": "Cities: Skylines II primer: the design ideas behind its world and characters",
  "description": "A starter guide to Cities: Skylines II, organized around worldbuilding, player experience, and character motivations.",
  "articleBody": "This primer is a structure-first way into Cities: Skylines II. It avoids time-sensitive patch notes and focuses on why the game works.\n\n1. World: what the setting treats as normal, and what it forbids.\n\n2. Experience: what the game nudges you to do, and what it wants you to hesitate over.\n\n3. Characters: how goals and costs connect to play and story.\n\n4. How to continue: what to watch for to understand it faster.",
